                                "sense_id": "1780d591-f8b5-3e00-ba80-78dcf594ebf6",
                                "text": "Mr. Beauchamp, a young man of learning and fine parts, happened to make an acquaintance with Mr. Grandison in the island of Candia, where they met as countrymen, which, from a sympathy of minds, grew immediately into an intimacy that will hardly ever end."
